• He sells the stardust of Xoroth through his servant Ur'dan.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Unrecorded",
			text = [=[No chronicle records how long Banehollow has dwelt in {link:felwood}Felwood{/link}, or what bargain binds him to the {link:shadow-council}Shadow Council{/link}.]=],
