			text = [=[The Deadwood are a tribe of {link:furbolgs}furbolgs{/link} of {link:felwood}Felwood{/link} who have been driven mad by the fel. They hold {link:deadwood-village}Deadwood Village{/link} in the south of the forest and {link:felpaw-village}Felpaw Village{/link} in the north, and they attack all who come near.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Madness",
			text = [=[The {link:timbermaw-furbolgs}Timbermaw{/link} say that the Deadwood are not evil by nature. It is the fel that pollutes their minds, and it cannot be undone. Their ritual totems reek of decay and despair. In their northern camp, a green and rotting brew bubbles in a cauldron, and it may be spreading the madness to the {link:winterfall-furbolgs}Winterfall{/link} furbolgs of {link:winterspring}Winterspring{/link}.]=],
